## Adaptive model routing
Use `modelrouter` when engineering work benefits from model selection for delegation, or when routing is explicitly requested. Honor existing lifecycle gates and reuse this task's framework, acceptance and qualified review. Small tasks stay with the parent without routing setup; ordinary questions and research do not implicitly need it.
Continue authorized work through required checks and fixes. Follow actual host capabilities and permissions; distinguish proposed routing from observed execution. The skill does not change the selected parent, global configuration or billing and is not a guaranteed per-turn hook.
<!-- modelrouter:end -->
